<title>USA: Dawson-Samberg holds 6.82 pct Diana stake.</title>
<headline>Dawson-Samberg holds 6.82 pct Diana stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Dawson-Samberg Capital Management Inc said Thursday it holds a 6.82 percent stake or 343,000 common shares in Diana Corp.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it paid $10.68 million for the stake and holds it for investment purposes.</p>
<p>It said its latest transactions include the net purchase of 99,300 shares between July 10 and August 27 at prices ranging from $20.9781 to $41.0944 a share.</p>
</text>
